==Battleground==
*3 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*3 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn after 333.33 seconds<sup>10,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn, delay 90~93.33 seconds<sup>2,700f~2,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As with its [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 48|Counterpart]], the best way to tackle on this stage is to stall the Metal Snaches in order to stack [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cats]] and other units that can deal with Mecha-Bun and its support. Do note that, this time around, Aku Doges also spawn at the start, and can easily give you trouble, so remember to pack some units that can deal with them without doing too much damage to the Metal Snaches. Do note that you should spend no more than 5 minutes, otherwise 3 Midnite Ds are out to punish you, unless you stacked up a high amount of attackers, of course.

